⚡ 2. Cache Repeated Selectors
●
Instead of writing this repeatedly:
$("#myList").append(...);
$("#myList").css(...);
●
Use a variable:
const $list = $("#myList");
$list.append(...);
$list.css(...);
✅ Improves performance and keeps code DRY.

